    <mxCell id="logical-cc513" value="OSPF per VRF on the core pair and DIST-S. Each VRF has one transit to the ISFW pair and a default route to it; no route leaks on the switches, so a packet that changes VRF goes through the ISFW. GUEST has no route to the ISFW at all. Identity (802.1X, EAP-TLS) puts a user in CORP or LEGAL; unknown devices land in VLAN 199." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#334155;spacing=2;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="logical-L4">
     <mxGeometry x="2744" y="312" width="572" height="112" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
