    <mxCell id="wireless-L8" value="Notes" style="" parent="0" />
    <mxCell id="wireless-cc83" value="&lt;b&gt;Rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;· SR-CORP: EAP-TLS certificates; the NAC returns VLAN 115 or 215 by identity group; 802.11r fast roaming; every campus AP joins the same pair, so a client keeps its address across buildings.&lt;br&gt;· SR-GUEST: captive portal, client isolation, anchored on the WLC pair, never routed internally. SR-IOT: room systems only, one key per device from the NAC.&lt;br&gt;· Branch APs run FlexConnect: SR-CORP and SR-GUEST switch locally to the branch's VLANs 110/210 and 700. No SSID for cameras, badges or building controls: they are wired." style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#F7FAFD;strokeColor=#E8EEF6;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="wireless-L8">
     <mxGeometry x="1996" y="270" width="1204" height="112" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
