    <mxCell id="multisite-cc159" value="&lt;b&gt;Reading a branch&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A BR-M site is the BR-M card with the row's prefix: VLANs 110, 120, 130, 210 (legal staff only), 700 and 990 at 10.nn, guest at 172.21.nn.0/24 with local breakout. A branch with its own NetBox site is drafted, not drawn here: netdiagrams draft --profile corporate." style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#F7FAFD;strokeColor=#E8EEF6;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="multisite-L4">
